OURI: Was that a kiss?

2
00:00:12,890 --> 00:00:16,430
OURI: Oh, damn it! I can't concentrate at all!

3
00:00:16,430 --> 00:00:18,640
OURI: Damn it! Damn it! Damn it!

4
00:00:17,850 --> 00:00:21,100
SIGN: I'm the One Who's Gonna Win

5
00:00:20,160 --> 00:00:24,860
OURI: And I need to finish my summer vacation 
homework by the day after tomorrow, too!

6
00:00:25,150 --> 00:00:26,830
OURI: A famous morning drama actress.

7
00:00:26,830 --> 00:00:28,740
ACTRESS: Let's go out to eat, Ouri-kun!

8
00:00:29,180 --> 00:00:31,070
OURI: A charismatic top model.

9
00:00:31,070 --> 00:00:32,659
MODEL: Are you free, Ouri-kun?

10
00:00:32,659 --> 00:00:34,750
OURI: Sorry, I'm busy.

11
00:00:34,750 --> 00:00:35,920
ACTRESS/MODEL: Aw...

12
00:00:35,920 --> 00:00:37,500
OURI: No matter how much others came onto me, 

13
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:39,750
OURI: it never resonated 
with me at all, and yet...

14
00:00:39,750 --> 00:00:43,430
OURI: What the hell's going on 
with my emotions?! Damn it!

15
00:00:43,790 --> 00:00:45,920
UTAGE: This place is closed, too.

16
00:00:45,920 --> 00:00:48,040
UTAGE: There's nowhere open...

17
00:00:46,350 --> 00:00:47,680
OURI: Utage Kinoshita!

18
00:00:53,610 --> 00:00:55,570
OURI: What's she doing here?!

19
00:00:59,400 --> 00:01:05,740
LYRICS: Hey!! It's just like sweeet magic!! Aha!

20
00:01:08,530 --> 00:01:11,280
LYRICS: Hi, it's me! 
The one with that killer smile!

21
00:01:11,280 --> 00:01:13,540
LYRICS: Stealing your gaze with a shocking style!

22
00:01:13,540 --> 00:01:14,660
LYRICS: Smooth as ever, I escort you

23
00:01:14,660 --> 00:01:16,120
LYRICS: And this voice, seducing you

24
00:01:16,120 --> 00:01:18,870
LYRICS: Ah, come on, let's dance; 
I'm aiming straight for your heart

25
00:01:19,390 --> 00:01:22,040
LYRICS: I am your ace darlin'

26
00:01:22,040 --> 00:01:24,630
LYRICS: Confidence? Yeah, I've got plenty

27
00:01:24,630 --> 00:01:25,630
LYRICS: Please Please

28
00:01:25,630 --> 00:01:29,260
LYRICS: Whisper just to me, call my name

29
00:01:29,260 --> 00:01:34,640
LYRICS: You're too popular, 
it drives me crazy and I'm not okay

30
00:01:34,640 --> 00:01:37,930
LYRICS: But I'm sorry, losing's not my thing

31
00:01:37,930 --> 00:01:38,850
LYRICS: Hey, girl

32
00:01:38,850 --> 00:01:39,850
LYRICS: Look this way!

33
00:01:39,850 --> 00:01:42,230
LYRICS: I see your smile, smile, smile, 
 I wanna make it all mine

34
00:01:42,230 --> 00:01:46,030
LYRICS: Crash, crash, crash, 
our special connection shines

35
00:01:46,030 --> 00:01:50,280
LYRICS: Dance, dance, 
our world is non-stop groovin'

36
00:01:50,280 --> 00:01:52,950
LYRICS: I'll show you my perfect 
A-side, side, side

37
00:01:52,950 --> 00:01:56,620
LYRICS: And my private B-side, side, side; 
I'll show you everything

38
00:01:56,620 --> 00:02:00,290
LYRICS: So take my hand and let's roll

39
00:02:00,290 --> 00:02:02,420
LYRICS: Sweet Sweet Sweet magic!!

40
00:02:04,590 --> 00:02:06,840
LYRICS: Sweetie honey Sweetie honey

41
00:02:09,900 --> 00:02:12,390
LYRICS: Sweetie honey Sweetie honey

42
00:02:12,390 --> 00:02:15,260
LYRICS: It's a spell that makes your heart race

43
00:02:15,260 --> 00:02:17,100
LYRICS: We can't go back

44
00:02:17,640 --> 00:02:20,600
LYRICS: You're falling in love with me, c'mon!

45
00:02:20,600 --> 00:02:21,620
LYRICS: Sweetie honey

46
00:02:21,620 --> 00:02:23,690
LYRICS: Sweet Sweet Sweet magic!!

47
00:02:29,570 --> 00:02:32,450
UTAGE: I focused too much on my job and 
fan activities during summer vacation

48
00:02:32,450 --> 00:02:35,020
UTAGE: and forgot to do my homework.

49
00:02:35,020 --> 00:02:37,460
UTAGE: I need to finish it by 
the day after tomorrow...

50
00:02:38,020 --> 00:02:39,200
