UTAGE: The Tamon-kun that's in front of me...

452
00:13:38,610 --> 00:13:40,900
OURI: What the hell am I sneaking around for?

453
00:13:41,300 --> 00:13:43,760
OURI: I just need to march in there, 
ask them what I want to know, 

454
00:13:43,760 --> 00:13:45,240
OURI: and get it over with!

455
00:13:45,800 --> 00:13:47,740
OURI: What the heck's going on with you two?

456
00:13:48,630 --> 00:13:50,090
UTAGE: We're dating!

457
00:13:56,030 --> 00:14:00,680
OURI: Am I... actually scared to ask?

458
00:14:16,980 --> 00:14:20,430
OURI: My father is a leading actor 
that represents Japan.

459
00:14:18,820 --> 00:14:22,490
SIGN: Film Awards Ceremony

460
00:14:19,980 --> 00:14:22,490
SIGN: Toshikazu
Sakaguchi

461
00:14:20,430 --> 00:14:22,490
OURI: It goes without saying, 
but he's handsome.

462
00:14:22,850 --> 00:14:25,240
OURI: My mother is a singer 
who defined a generation.

463
00:14:25,240 --> 00:14:27,370
OURI: Of course, she's also beautiful.

464
00:14:27,370 --> 00:14:30,080
OURI: Their son is currently 
a new idol in the spotlight.

465
00:14:29,740 --> 00:14:33,120
SIGN: Ouri
Sakaguchi

466
00:14:30,080 --> 00:14:33,120
OURI: Everyone would agree that his good 
looks rival any national treasure.

467
00:14:33,400 --> 00:14:36,020
OURI: The educational policy of the 
elegant Sakaguchi Family

468
00:14:36,020 --> 00:14:39,130
OURI: was a bit different from other households.

469
00:14:39,580 --> 00:14:40,640
OURI DAD: Ouri.

470
00:14:41,910 --> 00:14:45,730
OURI DAD: You inherited our superb genes 
and were born into this world.

471
00:14:46,180 --> 00:14:50,010
OURI DAD: Meaning you are a winner amongst 
winners just by being born.

472
00:14:50,290 --> 00:14:53,890
OURI (7): Yeah, I know! Everything 
goes ridiculously well for me!

473
00:14:53,890 --> 00:14:58,070
OURI DAD: But that's only 
if you live a mediocre life.

474
00:14:58,070 --> 00:15:01,190
OURI MOM: You will never be a winner 
in the entertainment industry.

475
00:15:01,450 --> 00:15:02,530
OURI (7): Huh?!

476
00:15:02,880 --> 00:15:05,280
OURI DAD: That's because your father...

477
00:15:05,670 --> 00:15:07,240
OURI MOM: ...and mother...

478
00:15:08,060 --> 00:15:09,670
BOTH: ...will continue to be winners!

479
00:15:10,450 --> 00:15:14,880
OURI MOM: Whether you like it or not, 
if you stand on the same stage as us, 

480
00:15:14,880 --> 00:15:17,460
OURI MOM: you'll be compared to us 
and always feel disappointed.

481
00:15:17,460 --> 00:15:19,700
OURI DAD: Having to face a giant obstacle 
known as your parents

482
00:15:19,700 --> 00:15:22,050
OURI DAD: is the fate of second-generation talent.

483
00:15:23,340 --> 00:15:26,760
OURI (7): B-But I want to be on TV, too!

484
00:15:26,760 --> 00:15:29,920
OURI DAD: Then you must be ready to surpass 
your mother and father!

485
00:15:30,470 --> 00:15:32,100
OURI MOM: Always remember this, Ouri...

486
00:15:32,100 --> 00:15:35,560
SIGN: Family Motto
Strength Is Power

487
00:15:32,500 --> 00:15:34,380
OURI MOM: Strength is power.

488
00:15:37,170 --> 00:15:39,690
OURI: I'm... gonna be the winner here!

489
00:15:40,620 --> 00:15:43,360
OURI: I'm... gonna be the winner here!

490
00:15:44,200 --> 00:15:46,780
OURI: Her relationship with Tamon 
doesn't matter!

491
00:15:51,990 --> 00:15:53,080
TAMON: I...

492
00:15:53,460 --> 00:15:55,180
TAMON: Kinoshita-san, I...

493
00:15:55,830 --> 00:15:56,830
UTAGE: Huh?!

494
00:16:00,060 --> 00:16:01,040
TAMON: Ouri-kun?!

495
00:16:01,040 --> 00:16:03,200
OURI: I'll teach you your homework!

496
00:16:03,200 --> 00:16:05,940
TAMON: You kicked down the door 
even though it was unlocked?

497
00:16:05,940 --> 00:16:07,090
MUSHROOMS: Gloom, gloom...

498
00:16:16,170 --> 00:16:18,310
OURI: Tamon's in the damn way.

499
00:16:18,630 --> 00:16:22,540
UTAGE: By the way, Gloomyhara-san, weren't 
you trying to say something earlier?

500
00:16:22,540 --> 00:16:24,250
TAMON: U-Um...

501
00:16:24,250 --> 00:16:26,240
OURI: It's not important, 
so don't worry about it.

502
00:16:26,240 --> 00:16:28,370
UTAGE: I'm talking to Gloomyhara-san.

503
00:16:28,370 --> 00:16:31,870
TAMON: It really isn't important, 
so please don't worry about it.

504
00:16:33,290 --> 00:16:35,390
TAMON: Isn't this great, Kinoshita-san?

505
00:16:35,390 --> 00:16:36,250
UTAGE: Huh?

506
00:16:36,600 --> 00:16:39,020
TAMON: Now, you'll be able to 
get your homework done.

507
00:16:39,330 --> 00:16:42,430
TAMON: It's great that Ouri-kun showed up.

508
00:16:43,790 --> 00:16:47,960
OURI: Yup, exactly. 
I'm sure this buffoon was useless.

509
00:16:47,960 --> 00:16:52,050
TAMON: I'm sorry for being a meaningless 
existence and occupying this space.

510
00:16:52,050 --> 00:16:55,950
OURI: I can learn lyrics and choreo in three 
minutes and it takes him thirty hours.

511
00:16:52,050 --> 00:17:00,090
MUSHROOMS: Gloom, gloom, gloom...

512
00:16:52,050 --> 00:16:59,930
SIGN: Sting

513
00:16:52,050 --> 00:16:59,930
SIGN: Sting

514
00:16:55,950 --> 00:16:57,600
OURI: He just doesn't have the knack for it.

515
00:16:57,600 --> 00:17:00,090
OURI: Actually, I'm surprised you were 
even able to survive this long.

516
00:17:00,760 --> 00:17:03,730
TAMON: I'm sorry that my brain capacity 
is less than an ostrich's!

517
00:17:03,730 --> 00:17:06,560
UTAGE: Tamon-kun spends 300 times more time 
on hard work than others. I love him.

518
00:17:06,560 --> 00:17:07,660
OURI: Tch.

519
00:17:06,690 --> 00:17:07,650
SIGN: Grrr...

520
00:17:09,369 --> 00:17:11,710
TAMON: Thank you very much, Kinoshita-san.

521
00:17:11,710 --> 00:17:14,589
TAMON: But it's true that 
I'm not being very useful...

522
00:17:14,589 --> 00:17:16,740
TAMON: so is there something else 
I can do for you?

523
00:17:18,780 --> 00:17:21,160
UTAGE: Then... please just exist.

524
00:17:21,160 --> 00:17:23,329
TAMON: Er... something other than that.

525
00:17:23,329 --> 00:17:26,589
TAMON: Then get me a shine muscat Daifuku 
and terrine de marrons!

526
00:17:26,589 --> 00:17:27,390
UTAGE: Wha—

527
00:17:27,390 --> 00:17:31,080
UTAGE: Humanity is not ready for Tamon-kun 
to be treated as an errand boy!

528
00:17:31,080 --> 00:17:32,720
OURI: Well, he doesn't have 
anything else to do, does he?

529
00:17:32,720 --> 00:17:35,910
TAMON: I'll be back soon. I'll buy some 
for you, too, Kinoshita-san!

530
00:17:35,910 --> 00:17:36,850
UTAGE: Wha—

531
00:17:37,300 --> 00:17:38,370
UTAGE: And there he goes...

532
00:17:38,370 --> 00:17:41,810
OURI: Kekeke! Now, no one's in my way.

533
00:17:42,150 --> 00:17:45,440
UTAGE: By the way, are you actually 
smart, Sakaguchi-san?

534
00:17:46,310 --> 00:17:51,120
OURI: What's that supposed to mean, huh?! 
I clearly look intelligent!

535
00:17:51,120 --> 00:17:53,280
UTAGE: Er, I was just curious...

536
00:17:53,590 --> 00:17:57,710
OURI: That's right. I guess you haven't 
seen me get serious in person.

537
00:17:58,120 --> 00:18:01,270
OURI: Academics? Of course, I'm great at it!

538
00:17:58,120 --> 00:18:04,210
SIGN: Work Hard and Practice Frugality

539
00:18:01,270 --> 00:18:04,210
OURI: How else could I play the prince 
character if I wasn't cultured?

540
00:18:04,210 --> 00:18:06,080
UTAGE: I-I guess?

541
00:18:06,080 --> 00:18:07,970
OURI: I've spent ten years in showbiz.

542
00:18:06,330 --> 00:18:08,380
SIGN: Co-star

543
00:18:06,470 --> 00:18:08,390
RANDOS: Ouri-chan, you're amazing.

544
00:18:06,920 --> 00:18:08,630
SIGN: Screenwriter

545
00:18:07,630 --> 00:18:09,960
SIGN: Editor

546
00:18:07,970 --> 00:18:10,570
OURI: In order to survive, I needed to be 
likable rather than unapproachable.

547
00:18:08,290 --> 00:18:10,210
SIGN: Creator

548
00:18:08,390 --> 00:18:09,270
RANDOS: Genius.

549
00:18:09,270 --> 00:18:11,700
RANDOS: You're truly amazing, Ouri-kun.

550
00:18:09,630 --> 00:18:11,630
SIGN: Critic

551
00:18:09,130 --> 00:18:10,960
Popular Celebrity

552
00:18:10,210 --> 00:18:12,010
SIGN: Producer

553
00:18:10,570 --> 00:18:14,340
OURI: In the end, no one can run away 
from what works.

554
00:18:11,130 --> 00:18:12,920
SIGN: Director

555
00:18:12,150 --> 00:18:13,300
RANDOS: You're lovely.

556
00:18:12,420 --> 00:18:14,130
SIGN: Cameraman

557
00:18:13,260 --> 00:18:14,340
SIGN: Director

558
00:18:13,300 --> 00:18:14,340
RANDOS: What a good boy.

559
00:18:13,720 --> 00:18:14,340
SIGN: Scriptwriter

560
00:18:14,770 --> 00:18:17,140
OURI: Today, I'm gonna get her 
to look my way for real!

561
00:18:19,400 --> 00:18:20,560
OURI: Utage-san.

562
00:18:20,560 --> 00:18:24,010
OURI: Tamon-kun's great, 
but won't I suffice as well?

563
00:18:24,470 --> 00:18:26,150
UTAGE: Ouri-kun's gone into idol mode!

564
00:18:26,420 --> 00:18:29,370
OURI: Oh, I'm sorry for calling you 
by your name without asking.

565
00:18:29,370 --> 00:18:33,450
OURI: If you're all right with it, 
may I continue calling you Utage-san?

566
00:18:33,820 --> 00:18:35,110
UTAGE: S-Sure.

567
00:18:36,450 --> 00:18:39,550
UTAGE: W-Wow... the background's 
all see through...

568
00:18:39,550 --> 00:18:41,840
OURI: I'm so transparent that people say 
that there's nothing more transparent

569
00:18:41,840 --> 00:18:43,850
OURI: than the beaches 
at Palau or Ouri Sakaguchi!

570
00:18:43,850 --> 00:18:45,870
OURI: I'll make you take this head on 
and make you fall for me!

571
00:18:45,870 --> 00:18:47,750
OURI: I'm just getting started!

572
00:18:47,750 --> 00:18:50,710
OURI: Please, have a seat, my princess.

573
00:18:50,710 --> 00:18:55,130
OURI: I'll lend you the notes I wrote up, 
so please feel free to use them.

574
00:18:53,840 --> 00:18:55,130
SIGN: Trigonometric Formulas

575
00:18:55,130 --> 00:18:57,340
OURI: You're correct! Well done!

576
00:18:57,340 --> 00:18:59,100
OURI: This is how you do this part...

577
00:18:59,100 --> 00:19:00,880
OURI: Oh! I'm sorry!

578
00:19:00,880 --> 00:19:03,310
OURI: I'll finish you with the reliable 
youngest member act.

579
00:19:03,310 --> 00:19:05,930
OURI: It's a little nerve-racking being 
here alone together, isn't it?

580
00:19:05,930 --> 00:19:07,100
OURI: But I'll maintain the innocence!

581
00:19:07,390 --> 00:19:08,810
UTAGE: Squee.

582
00:19:09,200 --> 00:19:10,570
OURI: Got 'em!

583
00:19:11,280 --> 00:19:14,570
UTAGE: So this is what Tamon-kun 
gets to see all the time...

584
00:19:15,540 --> 00:19:18,700
UTAGE: I'm so moved. 
I get to experience being my oshi.

585
00:19:18,700 --> 00:19:21,770
OURI: This hasn't gotten through 
to her at all, damn it!

586
00:19:21,770 --> 00:19:24,660
OURI: A normal chick would've 
melted into nothing by now!

587
00:19:29,740 --> 00:19:32,880
TAMON: I wonder what Kinoshita-san's 
favorite fruit is.

588
00:19:32,880 --> 00:19:34,120
TAMON: What do you like?

589
00:19:33,380 --> 00:19:36,300
SIGN: What do you like?

590
00:19:34,120 --> 00:19:35,420
UTAGE: Tamon-kun!

591
00:19:35,420 --> 00:19:38,840
UTAGE: Tamon-kun! Tamon-kun! Tamon-kun!

592
00:19:38,840 --> 00:19:43,850
SIGN: Fruits Daifuku Fair

593
00:19:39,360 --> 00:19:43,850
TAMON: Maybe I don't know anything 
about... Kinoshita-san after all...

594
00:19:44,490 --> 00:19:46,390
TAMON: I'd like...

595
00:19:49,650 --> 00:19:52,260
TAMON: to know more about her.

596
00:19:53,620 --> 00:19:55,530
UTAGE: I should eat soon.

597
00:19:54,400 --> 00:19:55,530
OURI: Why?

598
00:19:57,900 --> 00:20:00,030
OURI: What would he do right now?

599
00:20:01,010 --> 00:20:02,480
UTAGE: Sakaguchi-san?

600
00:20:05,930 --> 00:20:06,870
UTAGE: Huh?

601
00:20:11,180 --> 00:20:13,000
UTAGE: U-Um...

602
00:20:14,480 --> 00:20:15,970
TAMON: I'm back—

603
00:20:20,180 --> 00:20:22,760
UTAGE: G-Gloomyhara-san! This is just...

604
00:20:23,180 --> 00:20:24,340
UTAGE: What exactly is this?!

605
00:20:24,340 --> 00:20:26,360
OURI: I don't know what to do after this.

606
00:20:28,270 --> 00:20:29,960
OURI: What is this aura?

607
00:20:29,960 --> 00:20:31,230
OURI: Murderous intent?!

608
00:20:31,740 --> 00:20:33,950
OURI: Oh, I was just giving her 
a little fan service.

609
00:20:33,950 --> 00:20:36,690
OURI: To show her gratitude 
for always supporting F/ACE.

610
00:20:36,690 --> 00:20:37,690
UTAGE: Ah...

611
00:20:39,200 --> 00:20:40,070
OURI: Wha—

612
00:20:40,070 --> 00:20:42,200
UTAGE: Wait, is that Darkhara-san?!

613
00:20:42,950 --> 00:20:44,280
TAMON: Kinoshita-san...

614
00:20:46,620 --> 00:20:48,750
TAMON: doesn't like that.

615
00:20:50,110 --> 00:20:54,790
TAMON: Not that I'm an expert, or anything... 
but I've messed up before.

616
00:20:55,320 --> 00:20:56,360
OURI: Tch.

617
00:20:57,430 --> 00:20:59,670
UTAGE: What?! You bought every kind?!

618
00:21:00,370 --> 00:21:01,510
TAMON: I'm sorry.

619
00:21:02,700 --> 00:21:05,350
OURI: Is she really not going to look my way?

620
00:21:05,980 --> 00:21:08,370
OURI: Does she really not even...

621
00:21:08,770 --> 00:21:10,310
UTAGE: Sakaguchi-san.

622
00:21:10,660 --> 00:21:14,040
UTAGE: You probably did this because you 
don't like me and you were mad...

623
00:21:14,040 --> 00:21:16,160
UTAGE: But I can't approve 
of what you did earlier.

624
00:21:16,770 --> 00:21:19,400
UTAGE: You didn't really seem 
like yourself, Ouri-kun.

625
00:21:19,400 --> 00:21:20,400
OURI: What?

626
00:21:20,400 --> 00:21:25,620
UTAGE: Tamon-kun has a lot of fans, 
but you also have a lot of fans.

627
00:21:26,390 --> 00:21:28,830
UTAGE: So please make sure you 
take good care of him...

628
00:21:29,770 --> 00:21:34,350
UTAGE: The pure and sincere idol Ouri-kun 
that's loved by everyone.

629
00:21:34,920 --> 00:21:37,960
UTAGE: I mean, you can't be 
anyone but yourself, right?

630
00:21:44,350 --> 00:21:49,810
OURI: I thought I only wanted to get her 
to look my way because of my pride...

631
00:21:50,190 --> 00:21:53,940
OURI: I thought it was because I didn't 
want to lose to him as an idol.

632
00:21:56,110 --> 00:21:58,030
OURI: But that's not it.

633
00:21:56,110 --> 00:21:58,630
UTAGE: You bought so much. Thank you.

634
00:21:58,630 --> 00:22:00,520
TAMON: Is there anything you don't like?

635
00:21:59,140 --> 00:22:00,520
OURI: I...

636
00:22:00,520 --> 00:22:02,000
OURI: I'm in love with...

637
00:22:00,520 --> 00:22:02,960
UTAGE: I love them all! I'll take all of them!

638
00:22:02,960 --> 00:22:07,100
OURI: Utage Kinoshita.

639
00:22:12,600 --> 00:22:14,040
OURI: Damn it.

640
00:22:16,130 --> 00:22:21,170
